msgstr "The cron service is stopped: automatic backups will not run"

#: bitgnome/window.py
msgid ""
"Instala un gestor de cron y actívalo:\n"
"\n"
"    sudo pacman -S --needed cronie\n"
"    sudo systemctl enable --now cronie.service\n"
"\n"
"Vuelve a abrir la ventana para que se escriba la entrada de las copias "
"automáticas."
msgstr ""
"Install a cron manager and enable it:\n"
"\n"
"    sudo pacman -S --needed cronie\n"
"    sudo systemctl enable --now cronie.service\n"
"\n"
"Reopen the window so the automatic backup entry gets written."

#: bitgnome/window.py
msgid ""
"El paquete de cron está instalado pero su servicio no se está ejecutando:\n"
"\n"
"    sudo systemctl enable --now cronie.service\n"
"\n"
"En Debian y Ubuntu el paquete es cron y la unidad cron.service. Con fcron, "
"fcron.service.\n"
"\n"
"Comprueba el estado con:\n"
"\n"
"    systemctl is-active cronie.service"
msgstr ""
"The cron package is installed but its service is not running:\n"
"\n"
"    sudo systemctl enable --now cronie.service\n"
"\n"
"On Debian and Ubuntu the package is cron and the unit is cron.service. With "
"fcron, fcron.service.\n"
"\n"
"Check the state with:\n"
"\n"
"    systemctl is-active cronie.service"

#: bitgnome/window.py
msgid ""
"Las copias al conectar la unidad las programa el paquete Qt de Back In Time "
"mediante un servicio udev por D-Bus, que no está instalado.\n"
"\n"
"Opciones:\n"
"\n"
"  - Cambia la programación a una basada en cron (cada hora, cada día o cada "
"semana).\n"
"  - Instala el paquete Qt del núcleo si quieres ese modo."
msgstr ""
"Backups when the drive is plugged in are scheduled by the Qt package of Back "
"In Time through a udev service over D-Bus, which is not installed.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"\n"
"  - Change the schedule to a cron based one (hourly, daily or weekly).\n"
"  - Install the Qt package of the core if you want that mode."

